    "Only `primitive` may hold colour literals; `semantic` and `fixed` reference primitives as {name}; `alias` names a semantic, fixed or scale token.",
    "`accentOverride` lists the semantic tokens the administrator accent replaces (store/appSettings.ts sets --admin-<token>-light / -dark from lib/accent.ts).",
